In order to typecheck the file, you need an installation of Agda ≥ 2.6.3 (earlier versions might work but have not been tested).
You do not need an installation of the Agda standard library.

You typecheck the proof with the command
$ agda --safe --no-libraries Everything.agda
alternatively, you can use
$ make check

The proof will likely take a fair amount of time to be checked (expect 15 minutes on a higher end laptop).